# Global Tilt file-watch ignores (dockerignore syntax, relative to this folder).
# Shipped by devsuite (task B, docs/dotnet.md). Paths matching here never trigger
# any resource. The devsuite work dir (.tilt/) is NOT listed: its publish/ folder
# is what live_update syncs. Per-service extras: the tilt-ignore compose label.
# wwwroot/ and appsettings*.json are deliberately watched.
**/bin
**/bin/**
**/obj
**/obj/**
**/.vs
**/.vs/**
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/TestResults
**/TestResults/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.idea
**/.idea/**
**/*.md
**/*.swp
**/~*
**/*.tmp
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
